us events, limits, product enrolments and signatories; transaction-level time=
stamps, channels, amounts, statuses and error context; the latest closed loan=
 files available by the request date, including affordability, pricing and or=
igination risk fields; customer contacts, complaints and suggestions; campaig=
n design and customer responses. Label the result as a value proxy. It is not=
 net interest margin, return on equity or customer profitability.

